"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2012","url":"https://archives.nseindia.com/annual_reports/AR_SELAN_2011_2012_18102012054444.zip","source":"the data provider"}],"analysis":{"summary":"Antelopus Selan Energy Limited released its Q1 FY27 presentation detailing operational execution across Bakrol, Karjisan, Cambay, and Assam basins. Average sales for the quarter stood at 1,705 boepd alongside an inventory build-up of approximately 6,500 boepd due to limited custody transfer days with IOCL. Management reported strong financial performance with an EBITDA of Rs 93.2 Cr and reiterated its full-year guidance of reaching 2,500 boepd. Furthermore, the company highlighted new asset wins in DSF Bid Round IV and ongoing drilling and workover campaigns. Antelopus Selan Energy Limited reported its FY26 annual results, achieving an average sales volume growth from 1,193 boepd to 1,355 boepd, with a March 2026 exit rate of approximately 1,880 boepd.","themes":{"guidance":[{"claim":"The company's guidance of reaching 2,500 boepd in FY27 remains intact.","quote":"Our guidance of reaching 2,500 boepdin FY’27 remains intact, as impact from Frac will be seen from Q2 onwards","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-07-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=4524e1b9-2839-437c-9549-7b9cdd87e030.pdf"},{"claim":"The company starts FY27 with a base of 1,800+ boepd and has a roadmap to reach 2,500+ boepd in FY27.","quote":"We begin our FY 27 with a base of 1800+ boepd with a road map to 2500+ boepd in FY ‘27","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=030e0e83-0750-4a22-b56d-9b83d58f6676.pdf"},{"claim":"The company plans one new well for Cambay in H2 FY27.","quote":"Cambay: 1 new well planned in H2 FY’27","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=030e0e83-0750-4a22-b56d-9b83d58f6676.pdf"}],"demand_outlo